.SH NAME
git-work-user - List identities


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work user [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the identities this repository knows about.

.PP
JSON out by default, like every other reader; --format text prints one line
per identity, the id and the display name.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="json"
	Select the output formatting style. Valid values are [json,text]

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for user


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work(1)\fP, \fBgit-work-user-adopt(1)\fP, \fBgit-work-user-me(1)\fP, \fBgit-work-user-new(1)\fP
